# Syntax notes — CODEOWNERS is gitignore-LIKE, with real differences:
#   * The LAST matching pattern wins; owners do NOT accumulate. Never append a
#     catch-all (`* @team`) to the bottom of this file — it would silently strip
#     ownership from every rule above it. A default owner belongs at the TOP.
#   * Brace expansion {a,b}, negation (!) and ranges [a-z] are NOT supported.
#     Do not copy patterns from the org rulesets, which use braces — they would
#     parse as invalid and match nothing.
#   * Matching is case-sensitive.
#   * A team must have write access to this repo or its entries are silently
#     ignored. Verify:
#       gh api repos/Ingenio/{repoName}/codeowners/errors

/.github/CODEOWNERS     @Ingenio/ingenio-devops-engineers
/.cicd/                 @Ingenio/ingenio-devops-engineers
Dockerfile*             @Ingenio/ingenio-devops-engineers
dockerfile*             @Ingenio/ingenio-devops-engineers
DockerFile*             @Ingenio/ingenio-devops-engineers
DOCKERFILE*             @Ingenio/ingenio-devops-engineers
